@startuml UCD-system
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 DiamondBackgroundColor white
 DiamondBorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam dpi 180
title UCD-system: Aircon Retailer Workload Management System
' Traces: UC-01 to UC-15; finalized use-case-list v2.3.
' Sources: DEC-17, DEC-18, DEC-45, DEC-46, DEC-47; Brief R1-R11.
' Phone mechanism: SMS (DEC-48); initial credentials: email (DEC-49); includes: DEC-50.
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam usecaseBorderColor black
skinparam actorStyle stickman
actor "User\n{abstract}" as User
actor Manager
actor "Staff" as Staff
actor Driver
actor Technician
actor "IT Administrator" as ITA
actor "Email Service" as Email
actor "Email/Phone" as Notify
User <|-- Manager
User <|-- Staff
User <|-- ITA
Staff <|-- Driver
Staff <|-- Technician
rectangle "Aircon Retailer Workload Management System" {
 usecase "UC-01 Log In/out" as U1
 usecase "UC-02 Reset Password" as U2
 usecase "UC-03 Create User Account" as U3
 usecase "UC-04 Manage User Access" as U4
 usecase "UC-05 Manage Job" as U5
 usecase "UC-06 Manage Vans and\nWorkshop Servicing" as U6
 usecase "UC-07 Allocate Jobs /\nSet Weekly Schedule" as U7
 usecase "UC-08 Compare Staff" as U8
 usecase "UC-09 Manage Staff Request" as U9
 usecase "UC-10 View Manpower Dashboard" as U10
 usecase "UC-11 Set Availability\n+ Preferences" as U11
 usecase "UC-12 Manage Requests" as U12
 usecase "UC-13 View My Assignments\nand Workload" as U13
 usecase "UC-14 Complete Job" as U14
 usecase "UC-15 Notify Staff" as U15
 U1 -[hidden]down- U5
 U5 -[hidden]down- U6
 U6 -[hidden]down- U7
 U7 -[hidden]down- U9
 U9 -[hidden]down- U10
 U10 -[hidden]down- U11
 U11 -[hidden]down- U12
 U12 -[hidden]down- U13
 U13 -[hidden]down- U14
}
User -- U1
User -- U2
Manager -- U5
Manager -- U6
Manager -- U7
Manager -- U8
Manager -- U9
Manager -- U10
Staff -- U11
Staff -- U12
Staff -- U13
Technician -- U14
U3 -- ITA
U4 -- ITA
U1 -- Email
U2 -- Email
U3 -- Email
U15 -- Notify
U2 ..> U1 : <<extend>>
U8 ..> U7 : <<extend>>
U5 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U6 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U7 ..> U15 : <<include>>
U9 ..> U15 : <<include>>

legend bottom
Clock is the secondary system-event actor for UC-09 Job-start lapse.
It also starts Certification-expiry checks under FR-10/70 (no separate UC).
These events are drawn in SD-22 and SD-16 (DEC-59, DEC-68).
endlegend
@enduml
